.SS Authenticated HTTP
.TP
.B authenticated_get(&self, path: &str) -> Result<String, JssError>
.TP
.B authenticated_post(&self, path: &str, body_json: &str) -> Result<String, JssError>
.TP
.B authenticated_put(&self, path: &str, body_json: &str) -> Result<String, JssError>
.TP
.B authenticated_delete(&self, path: &str) -> Result<String, JssError>
Mengirim request HTTP yang sesuai ke path yang di-join dengan
.BR base_url .
Method ini memasang header otorisasi (token atau CSRF) dan menangani
retry dengan exponential backoff. Method mutasi (POST, PUT, DELETE)
